<div class="fn-container">
<p><b>FOOTNOTES</b></p>

<div class="fn-footnote">
<p><span></span><i>See</i>,<i> e.g.</i>,<i> Opinion and Order on Sanctions,&#160;Mata&#160;v.&#160;Avianca, Inc</i>., 678 F.Supp.3d 443, No. 22-cv-1461, (S.D.N.Y. June 22, 2023) (finding plaintiff's counsel "abandoned their responsibilities when they submitted non-existent judicial opinions with fake quotes and citations created by the artificial intelligence tool ChatGPT . . . .").</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<p>&#160;</p>

